                                "sense_id": "dbbab447-5c8d-33e6-99f5-2fca0b2fdd0f",
                                "text": "The object is throw or roll the bocces as close as possible to the pallino."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0794fd2e-be25-47e4-a4c0-b5a52e07f425",
                                "sense_id": "dbbab447-5c8d-33e6-99f5-2fca0b2fdd0f",
                                "text": "The side with their bocces closest to the pallino earns points."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e3ec5ebe-33bc-47b1-8acd-b160329c0452",
                                "sense_id": "dbbab447-5c8d-33e6-99f5-2fca0b2fdd0f",
                                "text": "When he first started we had to buy a smaller set of bocces because his hands were small."
                            }
                        ]
